00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:12.920
Dividend growth investing targets companies that raise payouts consistently rather than chasing

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:19.160
headline yields that can prove unsustainable. In today's choppy market with tech volatility

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:26.020
