00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:41.380
simple or quest trade using two clear filters, five year dividend growth above 5% and payout ratios

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:49.240
below 60%. This method has historically delivered stronger total returns in sideways or mildly declining

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:56.780
markets through reinvested cash flows. The main risks include sector concentration in financials

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:03.840
and utilities, plus the drag from rising rates on high payout names. Canadian investors receive

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:09.960
